\end{equation}
satisfies the hypotheses of Theorem \ref{thm:lr-insplit=2g-insplit}, namely:
\begin{enumerate}[label = (\alph*)]
\item If $v, w \in F^0$ such that $p(\F^i_v) \cap p(\F^j_w) \ne \emptyset $, then $p(\F^i_v) = p(\F^j_w)$; and 
