For Blasius base flow, the boundary conditions are:

\begin{equation}
\label{eq:BC2}
 v(y= 0,\infty) = \frac{\partial v}{\partial y}(y= 0,\infty) = \omega_{y}(y= 0,\infty) =0, \forall k_x,k_z \in \mathbb{R}, t \geq 0.
\end{equation}

