Our analysis is focused on three base flows: Couette, \red{plane Poiseuille}, and Blasius. For each base flow, we study the flow system \red{stability characteristics using our stability criterion} \teal{which was derived in \S~\ref{subsec: small gain}} by evaluating the following: 
