	Recently, as part of smart agriculture, drone based spraying systems \cite{MOGILI2018502} have been developed to reduce manual labor and automate the spraying of pesticides. On the same lines, we propose "SprayCraft" to compute near optimal route for variable rate precision pesticide spraying by drones in disease management ACPS as depicted by Fig \ref{fig:SprayCraft_Overview}.

