It follows that
$$\frac{\varphi(Nm)}{\varphi(N)}= \frac {\varphi(N)\varphi(m)\gcd(N,m)}{\varphi(N)\varphi(\gcd(N,m))}= \frac{\varphi(N)\varphi(m)m}{\varphi(N)\varphi(m)} = m=|S_N(m)|.$$

