We claim that $\psi$ is a $d$-to-1 surjective map. Indeed, Chinese remainder theorem (Lemma~\ref{le:CRT}) tells us that for  any $u \in S_d(m')$, the following system
\begin{equation*}
\begin{cases}
\ell\equiv u\pmod m,\\
\ell\equiv 1\pmod N
\end{cases}
\end{equation*}
has a solution, unique up to being modulo $\mathrm{lcm}(m,N)={mN}/{d}$.
