    \caption{Estimated half bandwidth (top), detuning (center), and detuning estimation error (bottom) of a simulated RF pulse with typical XFEL cavity parameters. Simulation state trajectories (dashed) are compared to LO estimations for ideal (filled circles) and mismatched (triangles) initial conditions, and a wrongly calibrated RF drive signal (stars).}
