\noindent\includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{5.png}
\caption{Time evolution of the ion (a-l) and electron (m-x) $V_x-V_y$ and $V_x-V_z$ velocity space densities at $x \in [-65, -60]\,d_{i,\text{up}}$, $y \in [-2.5, 2.5]\,d_{i,\text{up}}$ of the 2D $\theta = 30^\circ$ quasi-parallel shock run from $t = 7.6$ to $20\,\omega_{ci,\text{up}}^{-1}$. Each column is taken from the same snapshot. Phase space distributions are normalized by the maximum phase space density at each snapshot.}
