To track the time evolution of reflected ions, we again look at the $x-V_{ix}$ ion phase space distributions presented in Figure \ref{fig6} from $t = 0$ to $19\,d_{i,\text{up}}$.
The whole simulation domain in the x-direction from $-150\,d_{i,\text{up}}$ to $250\,d_{i,\text{up}}$ is shown to facilitate a detailed analysis of the foreshock region.
