\section{ Two Soliton Hierarchies Associated with $\mathfrak{sp}(6)$}\label{Sec:2}



In this section, we construct two integrable soliton hierarchies by selecting different spectral matrices in the loop algebra of $\mathfrak{sp}(6)$ and utilizing the Tu scheme. Building upon this foundation, we choose one of them and employ the Kronecker product to construct an integrable coupling system for it.

