		\left\langle V_{0},\frac{\partial U_{0}}{\partial u_{12}}\right\rangle = v ,\
	\end{align*}
	Substituting the above formulate into the trace identity yields
	\begin{align*}
		\frac{\delta}{\delta u}(2a+2b+2c)=\lambda^{-\tau}\frac{\partial}{\partial\lambda}\lambda^{\tau}
		\left(\begin{array}{c}
