	\subsection{ The Second Soliton Hierarchy Associated with $\mathfrak{sp}(6)$.\\}\label{Sec:2-2}
	In this section, we are going to construct another soliton hierarchy from the loop algebra $\widetilde{\mathfrak{sp}(6)}$. We consider another isospectral problem
