To enable direct comparison with the HMC results reported in Ref.~\cite{PhysRevB.100.075141}, we train a NF using the $2\pi$-canonicalization procedure to learn the path integral distribution in the particle/hole basis. Additionally, we extend our analysis to include the diagonal discretization alongside the exponential discretization.
