\section{Additional Results for the Four-Site Square Lattice}
\noindent
In the main part of this letter, we focused on the two-site model, where ergodicity issues are particularly pronounced and can be clearly visualized. To demonstrate the scalability and broader applicability of our method, we now present results for a two-dimensional four-site square lattice. At this system size, exact reference data from exact diagonalization (ED) is still available, allowing a direct quantitative comparison.

